  <jpcrp030000-asr_E00871-000:NotesRegardingReserveForSpecialDepreciationTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_head3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;※６　特別償却準備金は、租税特別措置法の規定に基づいて計上しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E00871-000:NotesRegardingReserveForSpecialDepreciationTextBlock>
